                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row justify-content-center">
                    <div class="col-lg-8">

                        <div class="differentiator">
                            <h3>We speak brief</h3>
                            <p>A lot of clients know they want something on the wall but can't quite articulate what. We ask the right questions to draw that out — your brand, your story, your customers, what you want people to feel. The result is a design that makes you say "yes, exactly."</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="differentiator">
                            <h3>What you see is what you get</h3>
                            <p>Before paint touches your wall, you'll see a scaled digital mockup showing exactly how the finished mural will look in your space. No surprises. No guesswork. Just a clear picture of what you're investing in.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="differentiator">
                            <h3>Design and painting, one person</h3>
                            <p>The same person who interprets your brief is the one holding the brush. That continuity means nothing gets lost between concept and execution — and you have one point of contact throughout.</p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

